          "jcr:created": "Tue Nov 28 2023 18:15:59 GMT+0000",
          "gradientDirection": "left-to-right",
          "text": "<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-75em\"><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\">Related categories</span></span></p>\n<p><a href=\"/content/stryker/us/en/portfolios/medical-surgical-equipment.html\">Medical and surgical equipment</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"/content/stryker/us/en/portfolios/medical-surgical-equipment/support-surfaces.html\">Support surfaces</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"/content/stryker/us/en/portfolios/medical-surgical-equipment/support-surfaces/stretcher-support-surfaces.html\">Stretcher support surfaces</a> | <a href=\"/content/stryker/us/en/portfolios/medical-surgical-equipment/support-surfaces/bed-support-surfaces.html\">Bed support surfaces</a> |&nbsp;<a href=\"/content/stryker/us/en/portfolios/medical-surgical-equipment/support-surfaces/pressure-injury-prevention-disposables.html\">Pressure injury prevention disposables</a></p>\n",
          "jcr:lastModified": "Tue Feb 20 2024 20:21:19 GMT+0000",
          "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/text",
          "textIsRich": "true",
          "leftMargin": "20"
        }
      },
      "col1": {
        "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
        "sling:resourceType": "wcm/foundation/components/parsys",
        "text": {
          "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
          "jcr:createdBy": "kent.schwartz@stryker.com",
          "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "kent.schwartz@stryker.com",
          "jcr:created": "Tue Feb 20 2024 20:18:06 GMT+0000",
          "text": "<h2><span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\"><span class=\"futura-bold\">SofCare Overlay at a glance</span></span></h2>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">The SofCare overlay combines three layers of interlocking air cells to create a contoured support surface. SofCare elevates the body’s sensitive pressure points off the bed surface, resulting in added support.</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Protects sensitive bony prominences susceptible to pressure injuries</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">2 inflation options</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Lightweight, waterproof, and easy to clean</span></li>\n</ul>\n",
          "jcr:lastModified": "Tue Feb 20 2024 20:24:48 GMT+0000",
          "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/text",
          "textIsRich": "true"
        }
      }
    },
